{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story Summary</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Veloria, a high school girl who wakes up in a place that feels both familiar and strange. Following traces of her memory, she solves puzzles and meets strangers who seem oddly familiar. What she seeks is not just a way out\u2014but the ultimate truth: <i>Who is she?</i> And <i>why has she returned to this place?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The girl awakens in front of a gloomy orphanage.<br>Ashes swirl in the air, revealing a truth long buried: the real orphanage was consumed in a fire many years ago.<br>What stands here now is a distorted world, pieced together from fragments of memory.<br>In search of the truth, she steps through its doors.<br>Shrouded in eerie darkness, the building reveals its secrets only by the faint glow of candlelight\u2026</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Highlights</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological depth reminiscent of Dostoevsky.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully crafted puzzles and level design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art style with a sense of transparency.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expressive CG scenes and visual effects.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles intertwined with deep narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shifting between memory and reality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration, stealth, and intense chase sequences.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character Descriptions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;This is You&quot; \u2014 Veloria</strong><br>A timid and introverted girl who dislikes social interaction.<br>She has a kind heart and is extremely persistent when it comes to things she deems necessary.<br>Due to her struggle with expressing herself, she often appears emotionless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859860/extras/63755a0bb072fd68d5d9aa76806af5f0.avif?t=1762802592\" width=780 height=615 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;This is You as a Child&quot; \u2014 Veloria</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859860/extras/2355028b5266e0764f332cac996b7a0b.avif?t=1762802592\" width=780 height=615 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grace</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harboring unspeakable secrets with &quot;Grace's Home,&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >appearing as a doll and moving with great difficulty,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >always presenting an air of arrogance and having a fondness for colorful things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859860/extras/52152c1366591872236f77edd2a545fa.avif?t=1762802592\" width=780 height=615 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ethan</strong><br>Soft-spoken like a girl, yet lively and passionate, capable of warming others with his presence.<br>As a child, his maturity led him to become Vellaria\u2019s closest friend, relying on her deeply.<br>He enjoys savoring the amber candy Vellaria gave him, letting its sourness erode his teeth until the taste of rust\u2014like Vellaria\u2019s hair\u2014seeps through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859860/extras/1f0d589a82eac3e7ca0ea1a19cea875b.avif?t=1762802592\" width=780 height=615 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ella</strong><br>Born with severe brittle bone disease, she is paralyzed from the waist down and confined to bed.<br>Always wearing a gentle smile, she rarely shows any strong emotions, possessing a maturity beyond her years.<br>She treats Vellaria with exceptional kindness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859860/extras/b20df51dcbef467357d70ba02bf34ebc.avif?t=1762802592\" width=780 height=615 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Grian</strong><br>The only teacher at Grace's Home, responsible for educating the children in various subjects, adored by them all.<br>Though an adult in appearance, he retains a childlike heart, often seeming foolishly innocent.<br>He frequently tells corny jokes to the children, though few respond\u2014except for Vellaria.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859860/extras/582f84a5190aed1c412a3afbab99b201.avif?t=1762802592\" width=780 height=615 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vianna</strong><br>Claims to be your best friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859860/extras/9f4a95dfa54c2f5e75f0c1910c894c9a.avif?t=1762802592\" width=780 height=615 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Enjoy your playthrough","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2859860/430777dec52a16819d6ba2165c5b5028ad16e8ef.jpg"},{"name":"Otherworld","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2859860/c416de946c65b22849ad1283b737731a788c616b.jpg"},{"name":"Grace","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2859860/64cd52d7a5abf03b512c4162129eca5acad1d2f2.jpg"},{"name":"Cute Doggy","pa